      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im just working in my garden and i accidentally poked my foot really deep with this old rusty trowel i found in the shed. its bleeding a bit but i already washed it with some soap. do i really need to go to the doctor for something like this or can i just put some peroxide on it and be fine?",
