    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just dont have the time to sit in an urgent care for hours u know? it doesnt even hurt that much now, just a bit of a sting. is there like... a stronger antiseptic i can use at home or maybe some antibiotics i can take instead so i dont have to go in? i really wanna just handle it myself.",
